      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "水晶の納品、ありがとうございます。\n聞いた通り不思議な輝きで、贈り物にピッタリです。\nさあ、次は職人に頼んで加工してもらわないと。\n首飾り？　それともフィビュラ？　うーん迷うなあ。",
        "official_en": "Thank you for delivering the crystal. Such a glow!\nNow to hire a jeweler who can fashion it. Should it\nhang on a necklace? Or perhaps it should adorn\na brooch? Decisions...",
        "real_en": null
      },
